{"candidateAnswer":"A memorable natural event in the night sky","evidence":"[D10:14 | 8:56 pm on 20 July, 2023] Melanie: I'll always remember our camping trip last year when we saw the Perseid meteor shower. It was so amazing lying there and watching the sky light up with streaks of light. We all made wishes and felt so at one with the universe. That's a memory I'll never forget.","itemId":"urn:uuid:432785d7-71c4-5083-8e56-3e7240f235c3","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:9dc477a8c177be60858ddf7e67f040f8cb8ffbed1b9920cb85902b1d591edbc3","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What did Melanie and her family see during their camping trip last year?","referenceAnswer":"Perseid meteor shower","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"9dc477a8c177be60858ddf7e67f040f8cb8ffbed1b9920cb85902b1d591edbc3"}}]}